 Keys  Click selects, again plays; Shift-, Option- or Fn-drag selects text
   space  Play or pause               ↑ / ↓  Select                   esc    Back, or stop typing
   n / p  Next or previous song       enter  Play, open or retry      R      Reconnect, or restart …
   ← / →  Back or forward 5 seconds   a      Add to the queue         ?      Show or hide the keys
   + / -  Volume up or down           l      Like or unlike           q      Quit; the music plays …
   s      Shuffle on or off           /      Search
   r      Repeat off, all or one      tab    Queue, Search, Library
